"┌ ┌ Help (? or Esc to close) ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐─┐"
"│ │ Global                                                                   │ │"
"│>│   ?                This help; the movement keys scroll it                │ │"
"│ │   q                Quit (asks first while writes are in effect)          │ │"
"│ │   Ctrl-C           Close a dialog or cancel the request; twice quits     │ │"
"│ │   L                Show or hide the log pane                             │ │"
"│ │   W u              Arm or disarm writes (read-only until then); the      │ │"
"│ │                    ledger                                                │ │"
"│ │   :                The command bar, with the commands listed below       │ │"
"│ │   p c              The profile dialog; connect again, or retry           │ │"
